(units-format)
*title Units and format
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*units/fmt xecfc km f.6
           xecfcdt m/sec f.3
           time sec f.2
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=6378.137000037913 y=0 z=0 xdt=10 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *file units.dat time xecfc xecfcdt
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *when time=10 stop
*end
